# Hidromet BMKG 2026
# No required secrets or environment variables for the current demo.
# Copy to .env.local only when you deliberately add configuration.
# Never commit real .env.local or .dev.vars files.
#
# Optional local tooling defaults (not required):
# WRANGLER_SEND_METRICS=false
# WRANGLER_WRITE_LOGS=false
# CLOUDFLARE_CF_FETCH_ENABLED=false
#
# Database, object storage, operational BMKG API, and SSO are NOT configured.
# Cloudflare account/credentials belong in your own Wrangler login/CI secrets.
# Do not expose production server secrets through NEXT_PUBLIC_ or VITE_ names.
